---
import process from '../data/process.json';
---

<section class="container-page py-16 sm:py-20" data-section="process">
  <p class="eyebrow">How I Work</p>
  <h2 class="section-title">협업 방식</h2>
  <ol class="mt-8 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-4">
    {process.map((p, i) => (
      <li class="rounded-2xl border border-line bg-surface p-5" data-reveal>
        <span class="text-sm font-bold text-accent tabular-nums">0{i + 1}</span>
        <h3 class="mt-2 font-bold">{p.step}</h3>
        <p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-ink-2">{p.desc}</p>
      </li>
    ))}
  </ol>
  <p class="mt-6 text-sm text-ink-3">슬랙·노션으로 협업하며, 평일 기준 24시간 안에 답변드립니다.</p>
</section>
